{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15976","headline":"失钗怨 · 王建","name":"失钗怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫女铜钗惜於玉，失却来寻一日哭。\n嫁时女伴与作妆，头戴此钗如凤凰。\n双杯行酒六亲喜，我家新妇宜拜堂。\n镜中乍无失髻样，初起犹疑在牀上。\n高楼翠钿飘舞尘，明日从头一遍新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}